_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Default volume snapshot location command"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-admin-vsl-delete_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Volume snapshot location deletion command"},{"depth":2,"slug":"oadp-cli-admin-nabsl-requests_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"NonAdminBackupStorageLocation approval request commands"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-admin-nabsl-prereqs_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Prerequisites"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-admin-nabsl-list_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"NABSL approval request listing command"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-admin-nabsl-describe_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"NABSL approval request description command"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-admin-nabsl-approve_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"NABSL approval request approval command"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-admin-nabsl-reject_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"NABSL approval request rejection command"},{"depth":2,"slug":"oadp-cli-must-gather_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Collect diagnostic data"},{"depth":2,"slug":"oadp-cli-nonadmin-about_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"OADP self-service"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-nonadmin-about-limitations_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Limitations"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-nonadmin-about-prereqs_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Prerequisites for non-administrator users"},{"depth":2,"slug":"oadp-cli-nonadmin-backups_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Non-admin backup management commands"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-nonadmin-backups-prereqs_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Prerequisites"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-nonadmin-backups-create_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Non-admin backup creation command"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-nonadmin-backups-list_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Non-admin backup listing command"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-nonadmin-backups-describe_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Non-admin backup description command"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-nonadmin-backups-logs_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Non-admin backup logs command"},{"depth":3,"slug":"oadp-cli-nonadmin-backups-delete_oadp-cli-plugin","text":"Non-admin backu