      <TableCell><code>-o</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>The output format. Supported values are <code>json</code> and <code>yaml</code>.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      </TableBody>
      </Table>
      <h3 id="oadp-cli-admin-schedules-describe_oadp-cli-plugin" class="group scroll-mt-20">Schedule description command<a href="#oadp-cli-admin-schedules-describe_oadp-cli-plugin" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p>To view the details of a schedule, use the following command:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc oadp schedule describe <schedule_name>"} lang="terminal" />
      <h3 id="oadp-cli-admin-schedules-delete_oadp-cli-plugin" class="group scroll-mt-20">Schedule deletion command<a href="#oadp-cli-admin-schedules-delete_oadp-cli-plugin" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
