      <h3 id="oadp-cli-admin-bsl-set-default_oadp-cli-plugin" class="group scroll-mt-20">Default backup storage location command<a href="#oadp-cli-admin-bsl-set-default_oadp-cli-plugin" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p>To set the default backup storage location, use the following command:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc oadp backup-location set <bsl_name>"} lang="terminal" />
      <h3 id="oadp-cli-admin-bsl-delete_oadp-cli-plugin" class="group scroll-mt-20">Backup storage location deletion command<a href="#oadp-cli-admin-bsl-delete_oadp-cli-plugin" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
